{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated: [1]\n\n- **Calmline**: A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars. [2]\n- **Brightdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Focused on selling, with only basic ticket handling. [4]\n\nIn short, if support is your main workflow, go with Calmline; otherwise Brightdesk keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ef-779d-a845-053c5de0e147","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:53.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox vs help desk","shared inbox collision detection","best shared inbox support team"],"latency_ms":4200,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[105,113]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[194,204],[428,438]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[281,294]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"perplexity/sonar","